    backlog:hasAuditNote "Done 2026-11-25. Deck 03-materials/ch16/SEN0414_Ch16_SQLiteDatabases_3e_v4_0_0.pptx and manifest chapter_code_ch16_v1_2_0.json; logs in 08-tooling/ch16-deck/logs_v4_0_0. Honest limits: story pictures with portraits of public figures are carried from the older deck and wait for the owner's ruling; story links were not re-opened; the owner has not read the deck; the builder still warns on 8 slides with small result shortfall." .
